        "detailed_description": "<h1>Blackjack</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/extras/52a1f2a7586e900574cd56818a61e1f8.avif?t=1788509674\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blackjack pulls you into the thrill of the gamble—every card flip is a rush, every decision a test of nerve. Feel the tension rise as you chase 21, balancing risk and reward in a game where one move can mean triumph or defeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/extras/90c0b44a19bfa5624bf1ac65a7d41a99.poster.avif?t=1788509674\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/extras/90c0b44a19bfa5624bf1ac65a7d41a99.webm?t=1788509674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/extras/90c0b44a19bfa5624bf1ac65a7d41a99.mp4?t=1788509674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Blackjack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackjack is a game of pure tension and excitement, where every card drawn keeps you on the edge of your seat. Will you play it safe or risk it all? Each round is a battle of luck and strategy, where fortunes can change in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/extras/5e17b9b20151dd643ee8740b3603c7ae.poster.avif?t=1788509674\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/extras/5e17b9b20151dd643ee8740b3603c7ae.webm?t=1788509674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/extras/5e17b9b20151dd643ee8740b3603c7ae.mp4?t=1788509674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thrill builds as you push your luck, feeling the rush of a perfect hand or the heartbreak of going bust. Every decision matters, every moment counts—it's a test of nerve, instinct, and sheer adrenaline-fueled fun.</p>",
